{
  "message": "The title-screen and logo devlog adds no verified evidence of your game’s playable progress. Halfway through, the references remain useful starting material, but the playable goal is still at risk. Drop the trailer storyboard and publish a bare jump-and-landing build before adding one short level. We’ll meet after the third sprint; I look forward to an openable build and your devlog notes ;)",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Drop the trailer storyboard and reserve the remaining 20–30 stated hours for the playable goal.",
      "itemId": "cmw2b6hgm00z9xoz8wh9h1eua",
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Make the jump and landing work in a bare Godot scene, and publish a build anyone can open.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Build one short first level with simple shapes and the working jump, then publish the updated build with launch instructions.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

